{
  "kanda": "yuddha",
  "sarga": 23,
  "title": "Rama explains to Lakshmana the various portents",
  "sourceUrl": "https://www.valmikiramayan.net/utf8/yuddha/sarga23/yuddhasans23.htm",
  "romanUrl": "https://www.valmikiramayan.net/utf8/yuddha/sarga23/yuddhaitrans23.htm",
  "translator": "K. M. K. Murthy",
  "introduction": [
    "Rama explains to Lakshmana the various portents, he observes around him, that signal a destructive war fare. He orders for formation of battalions in the army and surges forth together with the battalions towards Lanka."
  ],
  "closing": [
    "इत्यार्षे श्रीमद्रामायणे आदिकाव्ये युद्धकाण्डे त्रयोविंशः सर्गः",
    "Thus completes 23rd Chapter of Yuddha Kanda of the glorious Ramayana of Valmiki, the work of a sage and the oldest epic."
  ],
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "6.23.1",
      "label": "6.23.1",
      "numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "devanagari": "निमित्तानि निमित्तज्ञो दृष्ट्वा लक्ष्मणपूर्वजः |\nसौमित्रिम् सम्परिष्वज्य इदम् वचनम्ब्रवीत्",
      "iast": "nimittāni nimittajJṇo dṛṣṭvā lakśmaṇapūrvajaḥ |\nsaumitrim sampariṣvajya idam vacanambravīt",
