    {
      "id": "6.23.2",
      "label": "6.23.2",
      "numbers": [
        2
      ],
      "devanagari": "परिगृह्योदकम् शीतम् वनानि फलवन्ति च |\nबलौ घम् सम्विभज्येमम् व्यूह्य तिष्ठेम लक्ष्मण",
      "iast": "parigṛhyodakam śītam vanāni phalavanti ca |\nbalau gham samvibhajyemam vyūhya tiṣṭhema lakśmaṇa",
      "translation": "\"O, Lakshmana! Acquiring this region endowed with cold water and woods abounding in fruits, let us speedily divide this multitude of forces into battalions and drawing it up in battle array, we shall stand attentive.\"",
