        4
      ],
      "devanagari": "वाताश्च कलुषा वान्ति कम्पते च वसुन्धरा |\nपर्वताग्राणि वेपन्ते पतन्ति च महीरुःआः",
      "iast": "vātāśca kaluṣā vānti kampate ca vasundharā |\nparvatāgrāṇi vepante patanti ca mahīruḥāḥ",
      "translation": "\"Winds are blowing with dust and earth is trembling. Mountain- tops are quivering and trees are falling down.\"",
