        8
      ],
      "devanagari": "रजन्यामप्रकाशस्तु सम्तापयति चन्द्रमाः |\nकृष्णरक्तांशुपर्यन्तो लोकक्षय इवोदितः",
      "iast": "rajanyāmaprakāśastu samtāpayati candramāḥ |\nkṛṣṇaraktāṃśuparyanto lokakśaya ivoditaḥ",
      "translation": "\"The splendorous moon as though rising at the time of universal dissolution, invested with a black and red halo is tormenting the mind this night.\"",
